# ripgrep/fd/ast-grep: Raven ships guidance under dot-directories, and all
# three tools share the same `ignore` crate, which skips them. Without these
# negations `rg pattern common/` silently skips all of it. The same file is
# shipped to installed projects as common/.ignore (#238).
!.agents/
!.claude/
!.codex/
!.raven/
